The projection code in ctmm received a large overhaul in version 0.5.0. You can now reproject your data very easily, as demonstrated here: https://ctmm-initiative.github.io/ctmm/reference/projection.html#examples

Unfortunately a bug slipped into as.telemetry(), when using the projection argument. This bug is fixed in the development branch, which you can install via:

devtools::install_github("ctmm-initiative/ctmm")

Apologies,
Christen

